CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'voltage_swing_adjust ==
 			     lane_voltage_pre_emphasis->voltage_swing[j]'
#2205: FILE: drivers/gpu/drm/bridge/ite-it6505.c:2079:
